### Collection GET
GET http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr-FR,fr;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,en;q=0.7

# Anglais (priorité) Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9,fr;q=0.8,es;q=0.7
# Espagnol (priorité) Accept-Language: es-ES,es;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,fr;q=0.7
# Polonais (priorité) Accept-Language: pl-PL,pl;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,fr;q=0.7

### Collection GET avec pagination HATEOAS 
GET http://localhost:3000/categories?page=1&itemsPerPage=2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


### Collection POST
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Romance",
  "description": "Livres qui traitent des relations amoureuses."
}

### Item GET
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr-FR,fr;q=0.9,en;q=0.8

### Item PATCH 
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/1
Content-type: application/json

{
  "description": "Livres qui traitent des relations amoureuses et de l'amour."
}

### Item DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/-1
